[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13441.349, "timestamp": "03:44:01", "text": "还有别的什么？比如，它到底好不好玩？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13445.429, "timestamp": "03:44:05", "text": "比如说，这件事真的那么严重吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13447.429, "timestamp": "03:44:07", "text": "绝对不是。它更像是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13449.87, "timestamp": "03:44:09", "text": "呃，你大概只是在做自己的事吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13453.11, "timestamp": "03:44:13", "text": "不管是商业还是其他方面，大部分都是戏剧性的事件。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13454.87, "timestamp": "03:44:14", "text": "就像这个朋友圈一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13458.349, "timestamp": "03:44:18", "text": "那群朋友。哦，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13461.189, "timestamp": "03:44:21", "text": "上帝。呃，你还没经历过任何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13463.83, "timestamp": "03:44:23", "text": "欺凌、霸凌或其他任何形式的欺凌行为。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13465.75, "timestamp": "03:44:25", "text": "正确的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13468.95, "timestamp": "03:44:28", "text": "我的意思是，我当时是在欺负和霸凌别人，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13470.63, "timestamp": "03:44:30", "text": "是的，肯定会有一些被宠坏的富人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13473.99, "timestamp": "03:44:33", "text": "孩子们会像大麻一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13476.309, "timestamp": "03:44:36", "text": "我的天哪，你说的是人民。哦，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13485.269, "timestamp": "03:44:45", "text": "上帝。这是真的。没错。我的意思是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13487.03, "timestamp": "03:44:47", "text": "没做，但我就是……我就叫他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13495.91, "timestamp": "03:44:55", "text": "是的。被宠坏了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13497.51, "timestamp": "03:44:57", "text": "是的，不过，你基本上可以避免这种情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13499.99, "timestamp": "03:44:59", "text": "反正他们就是这样。"}]